  <!-- Local Tips -->
  <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2rem] shadow-xl border border-slate-100">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
      <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-med-gold flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 18h6"/><path d="M10 22h4"/><path d="M15.09 14c.18-.98.65-1.74 1.41-2.5A4.65 4.61 0 0 0 18 8 6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .23 2.23 1.5 3.5A4.61 4.61 0 0 1 8.91 14"/></svg>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Expert Tips</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div>
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Respect the heat</p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">Pompeii has almost no shade, and from June to September the stone streets throw the heat back at you. Go at opening time, carry a hat and sunscreen, and plan the open areas for the morning. October to April is the comfortable season for both sites.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Wear proper shoes and carry water</p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">The Roman paving is uneven, with high kerbs and deep ruts. Trainers with a good grip, not sandals. Bring a refillable bottle: Herculaneum has no restaurant inside, only vending machines by the entrance bridge, and eating is allowed only in designated areas at both parks.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Travel light</p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">Pompeii admits bags up to 30x30x15 cm and Herculaneum up to 35x30x15 cm. Larger bags go to the left luggage, which is free at Herculaneum. If you are moving hotel the same day, the Circumvesuviana with suitcases is a poor idea, so drop them first.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Bring ID and book ahead in season</p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">Pompeii tickets carry your name and staff can check it. From spring to mid October, book the morning slot online on the official Vivaticket site, since resellers often charge more for the same entry.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Check the official sources the day before</p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">Timetables, fares and site openings change. The pages to check are <a href="https://pompeiisites.org/en/visiting-info/timetables-and-tickets/" class="text-med-blue hover:underline" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">pompeiisites.org</a>, <a href="https://ercolano.cultura.gov.it/biglietti/" class="text-med-blue hover:underline" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">ercolano.cultura.gov.it</a>, <a href="https://www.eavsrl.it/" class="text-med-blue hover:underline" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">eavsrl.it</a> for the train and <a href="https://sitasudtrasporti.it/" class="text-med-blue hover:underline" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">sitasudtrasporti.it</a> for the bus. For arrivals from the airport or Naples, see our guide to <a href="/en-us/guide/getting-here/" class="text-med-blue hover:underline">getting here</a> and to <a href="/en-us/blog/amalfi-coast-by-train/" class="text-med-blue hover:underline">the Amalfi Coast by train</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

